 Statuses: `open`, `doing`, `done`. Errors are `{"error":"..."}`.
 
+`DELETE /orgs/{oid}/users/{uid}` removes the user from the members of every project
+of the org, clears the user's assignments in those projects, and takes the user out
+of the org: the user keeps an account but has no org and no org-admin rights, so
+every project read or write by that user is 404 from then on.
